      </div>
      <div class="package card growth">
        <h2>Growth</h2>
        <p class="desc">Boost your business with consistent growth. Includes 20 posts per month, 4 short videos/reels, caption writing, hashtag strategy, a content calendar, and basic analytics reports.</p>
