          <li>20 Posts/Month</li>
          <li>4 Short Videos/Reels</li>
          <li>Caption Writing</li>
          <li>Hashtag Strategy</li>
          <li>Content Calendar</li>
          <li>Basic Analytics Reports</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="package card premium">
        <h2>Premium</h2>
        <p class="desc">Maximize your brand’s online presence. Includes premium content and strategy, 30 posts per month, 8 short videos/reels, advanced analytics, and personalized strategy sessions.</p>
